From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: timvdhoorn <timvdhoorn@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 22:05:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] feat(web): status in the gutter and snooze on boring
 sidebar rows

Boring sidebar rows indented every title past the project icon and kept the
status word on the right, so long titles lost most of their text. The status
icon (or, without a status, the age) now sits in a leading slot under the
project icon, and the title runs to the row's right edge. The status word
stays in the row's accessible name and in a tooltip on the icon; multiline
rows line their branch line up under the title.

On hover or keyboard focus a boring row now offers Snooze next to Settle, with
the same gating and open-menu handling as the card rows.
